# Styles

Plain (2), text Jane Doe and Smith, John (2020), author Donald E. Knuth, noauthor (see 2020 p. 3), nocite, missing (5), two (before2, 4 after), caps Jane Doe And Smith, John (2020), bare (2). Author caps Van Der Berg, Anna, bare caps Van Der Berg, Anna 1999, noauthor bare 2011. Numeric (2, 4, 7, 8) and (see 8 p. 2). Same author and year: (3) and Donald E. Knuth (1984a), then (2) again. From JSON (1) and Evans Eve (2010). Unknown style (Zed Z, 2011). Twice missing (5).

